---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import ContactButtons from '../components/ContactButtons.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Custom & Made-to-Order Kundan Jewellery in Delhi | Patel Kundan Art"
  description="Custom kundan and jadau jewellery made to order in Karol Bagh, Delhi. Bring a design, a photograph, or old gold you would like remade by hand."
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="For individuals"
    title="One piece, made properly, for you."
    lede="You do not need to be a jeweller to have something made here. Bring a design, a photograph of something you liked, or gold you already own — and we will make it by hand."
  >
    <ContactButtons message="custom" waLabel="WhatsApp us about a custom piece" />
  </PageHero>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">What people come to us for</p>
      <div class="two">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Remaking old gold</h2>
          <p>
            Jewellery that sits in a locker because nobody wears it any more — a set
            from a wedding a generation ago, pieces that came from two sides of a
            family, something broken or out of fashion.
          </p>
          <p>
            We melt nothing without telling you what you have first. The old piece is
            weighed in front of you, and what comes back is weighed the same way.
          </p>
          <ContactButtons class="cta" message="remake" waLabel="Ask about remaking old gold" showCall={false} />
        </div>
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Made to your design</h2>
          <p>
            A bridal set, a single piece for an occasion, or a copy of something you
            saw and could not find anywhere. Send a photograph — most conversations
            here start with one.
          </p>
          <p>
            Kundan and jadau is what we are known for, but we manufacture across gold
            jewellery. If a design is beyond what we do well, we will tell you rather
            than take the order.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section on-sunk">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow prose">
      <h2>Honest expectations</h2>
      <p>
        Everything is made to order by hand, so it takes time — this is not a shop
        where you choose a piece and take it home the same day. We will tell you the
        realistic timeline for your piece before you commit to it, and we would
        rather lose the order than promise a date we cannot keep.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not quote rates on a website. What a piece costs depends on what it is.
        Send us the design and ask.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section on-ink">
    <div class="wrap wrap--narrow">
      <h2>Send us a photograph of what you have in mind.</h2>
      <p class="lede">It is the quickest way to find out what is possible.</p>
      <ContactButtons class="cta" message="custom" waLabel="WhatsApp us about a custom piece" />
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .two { display: grid; gap: 2.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  @media (min-width: 800px) { .two { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3.5rem; } }
  .cta { margin-top: 1.5rem; }
</style>
